=2 Walkthrough
* Visit any {p:Cavernous Maw} in the following locations:

:* {z:Sauromugue Champaign}: J-10, requires passing through Banishing Gate #3 in {z:Garlaige Citadel}.
:* {z:Batallia Downs}: H-5, behind the hill on the map.
:* {z:Rolanberry Fields}: H-6, up against the small hills on the map.

* Click on the Cavernous Maw for a cutscene. You will then be randomly placed in one of the three areas above, regardless of where you entered from. Once the cutscene is finished, the next Mission, {M:Back to the Beginning|Back to the Beginning|Back to the Beginning}, will be active.
* If you Warp out (or die) before you unlock any other Maws from the past, or any {p:Survival Guides|Survival Guide} or {p:Home Points|Home Point}, you must return to the Cavernous Maw in the zone you were randomly placed in.
* From this point on, it will be possible to unlock passages between present areas and {p:Shadowreign|Category:Areas} areas by using a Cavernous Maw in a Shadowreign area.
* Travel to the other two Shadowreign {p:Cavernous Maws} to unlock them.
* A Cavernous Maw will be unresponsive in the present until it has been activated in a Shadowreign area.
** See {p:Cavernous Maws} for the locations of more Maws throughout the past.

